    "title": "Princess Mermaid At Hair Salon",
    "description": "Take care of a beautiful princess mermaid in this dress-up game. Head over to the spa and make sure to clean her tail well, use soap to wash her, and don\u2019t forget to rinse the foam afterward. Makeovers are trendy and cool right now so go to the salon and style the mermaid\u2019s hair. Try as many hairstyles as you like until you find the one which fits her perfectly. Going to the gym isn\u2019t easy but we have prepared a set of exercises that will make the whole experience fun again. Follow the instructions you will be shown and complete the princess\u2019s daily workout. Before you go shopping, check to see if you have enough money to pay for the items you want to buy. You can earn coins and gems by playing the six mini-games we have created. The first one is located on the top left corner of the minigames menu: complete levels by swapping mice of different colors on a game board to make a match of three of the same color, eliminating those mice and replacing them with new ones, which could create further matches. Interesting minigames that are featured are an arcade-style game (you control a pink bird by tapping on the center of the screen, while the bird tries to escape the cat\u2019s paws), another one in which you have to cut as many fruits as you can to obtain coins and so much more. It is time to go to the shop and buy the mermaid all the things she wants. Dress her up and try new outfits every day! Accessories are a girl\u2019s best friend so make sure to check them out. Also, don\u2019t forget to buy her some food, I am certain that she is hungry. Next, head over to her home and then to her kitchen and feed her. After all this fun the mermaid is tired and needs to sleep. Go to her room, tuck her in bed, and wish her a goodnight's sleep. As long as you keep her entertained, clean, and fed she is going to be happy and you will level up faster.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the many amazing features of this game: \r\n- Instructions at the b